      "content": "I'm not sure I'm comfortable with a lift-and-shift approach, considering the specialized server cluster's unique configuration and the potential for data inconsistencies. I'd like to propose a more thorough assessment of the dataset migration, including a review of the data's integrity and a potential re-encoding of the metadata to ensure compatibility with the new architecture. Can we at least discuss the feasibility of a more comprehensive approach?",
      "source": "target",
